          "End the day by reconciling the temporary assignment letters queue and explaining the carryover. The handoff should name what moved, what is waiting, who owns the next check, and which evidence is still missing. Keep the queue short enough to finish; a healthy average can hide one aged case. At HR Coordinators, the temporary assignment letters handoff note is stored with the employee record."
