          "If a temporary assignment letters exception touches a payroll date, an access grant, a privacy question, or an employee commitment, the dependent action waits for the accountable HR owner. Do not infer approval from silence or from a prior similar case. The resolution should say what was decided and where the evidence lives. At HR Coordinators, the temporary assignment letters resolution is dated and linked to the source."
